{"id":229120,"name":"M10-2B-02, 2P","headline":"Staggering & Soothing 2 BDR w/ Pool View |Free Pool & Beach Access","summary":"This trendy 2 bedroom apartment is located in Gouna's only beachfront community with a 24/7 free pool and beach access and is managed by Xuru Stays.","description":{"Space":"\r\n\r\nThis trendy 2 bedroom apartment is located in Gouna's only beachfront residence - Mangroovy with free pool and beach access. Mangroovy is closest to the Marina (10 min walk). \r\n\r\nThe 2 bedroom apartment comes with an open plan fully equipped kitchen, 2 full bathrooms, a guest bathroom with 1 and a living room , \r\n\r\nIt also features a 65 inch smart TV with Airplay and cable channels, washing machine, a Nespresso machine, kettle and a microwave. The apartment is great for couples. \r\n\r\nThe styling is made with Staggering & Soothing taste to ensure guests have a wonderful and relaxing experience. \r\n\r\n\r\nAt Xuru Stays, we’re committed to providing our guests the magical hospitality they deserve.\r\n\r\n","Access":"\r\n\r\nGuests have access to the entire apartment\r\n\r\n","Interaction":"\r\n\r\nWe are more than happy to answer all of your questions 24/7. Guests can text and call anytime they need help and our team will be there in about 30 mins to solve any issue immediately.\r\n\r\nAt Xuru Stays, we’re committed to providing our guests the magical hospitality they deserve.\r\n\r\n","Neighborhood":"\r\n\r\n-Mangroovy residence is uniquely located 800 meters from Abu Tig Marina. Guests will be able to walk 10 minutes and get to it. \r\n-'Bright Star' supermarket is right in front of the residence towards the Marina.\r\n-Mangroovy is home to the 'Zouni' beach lounge (located at Mangroovy's beach)\r\n- 'The Smokery', a local favorite is also located 450 meters from the residence.\r\n\r\n","Transit":"\r\n\r\nFree outdoor parking is available. \r\nTuktuks are available to take you anywhere in El Gouna.\r\n\r\n","Notes":"\r\n\r\nPlease note that smoking is not allowed inside the apartment. A fine of $100 may be imposed in case of smoking indoors."},"city":"El Gouna","capacity_of_guests":4,"number_of_bedrooms":2,"number_of_beds":4,"number_of_bathrooms":2,"number_of_stars":4,"location_address1":"Mangroovy Residence","location_address2":"","location_lat":"27.402484","location_lng":"33.6511438","booking_link":null,"airbnb_link":null,"rental_type":"apartment","featured":false,"cleaning_fee":25,"checkin_time":15,"checkout_time":12,"booking_sync_cleaning_fee_id":451009,"active":1,"can_book":1,"agreement":"• Kindly note that a damage deposit of USD 150 (or the equivalent in EGP) is required. The payment is collected online as part of the reservation payment and will be reimbursed on the checkout day, provided no damages are incurred.\r\n  • Smoking (including shisha) inside the unit is strictly not allowed. However it is allowed in the unit’s balcony (if applicable). A fine of $100 may be imposed in case of smoking indoors.\r\n • Partying, excessive noise and public alcohol drinking is not allowed. In case of violations, security will be notified and appropriate strict actions will be taken. \r\n • Visitors are not allowed, only confirmed guests stated in the reservation will be granted entry. \r\n• Egyptian & Arab couples ONLY are required to provide proof of marriage according to Egyptian law. Guests are required to send their IDs or passports to the email (id@xurustays.com) or (id.elgouna@xurustays.com) as per the local regulations.\r\n• El Gouna entry permits require 48 hours to be issued, in case guest IDs and passports are sent less than 48 hours before check in date, entry permits are subject to delay or may not be granted. \r\n • Cancellation more than 30 days before the arrival date, we keep 10% of the total price of the stay.\r\n • Cancellation between 15 days and 30 days before the arrival date, we keep 50% of the total price of the stay. \r\n• Cancellation between 7 days and 15 days before the arrival date, we ke