r,h_1600,q_auto,w_2400/v1722766987/4wsg_e4111527-63cd-480d-9689-90b2c2c8e84c.jpg?_a=BACMTiGT","position":21,"rental_id":229120,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:10:52.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:10:52.000000Z"}],"image":{"id":4374190,"path":"https://res-2.cloudinary.com/bookingsync/image/upload/c_fill,f_auto,fl_progressive,g_center,h_1600,q_auto,w_2400/v1722766648/4wsg_62bd3e54-585c-47a4-b950-402e67544cfe.jpg?_a=BACMTiGT","position":1,"rental_id":229120,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:10:52.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:10:52.000000Z"},"reviews":[{"id":5345704,"review":"The apartment is well furnished and very clean.","rental_id":229120,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:31.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:31.000000Z"},{"id":5350595,"review":"If you prefer to be ignored when it is terrible stay and and all you get is a weak response from the costumer service when you have big issues, then go for it. ","rental_id":229120,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:31.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:31.000000Z"},{"id":5353536,"review":"Good arrangement good care and communications","rental_id":229120,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:31.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:31.000000Z"},{"id":5385482,"review":"I had a great vacation in this wonderful apartment,the host was very responsive ,the decor was nice , and the services provided were excellent. The beds were also very comfortable, making it easy to relax. However, the biggest drawback for me was the overwhelming smell of dampness throughout the apartment, likely due to the lack of sunlight. Aside from that, the place was very clean and well \n maintained.","rental_id":229120,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:37.000000Z"},{"id":5400576,"review":"Room air conditioners make a smell when the temperature is higher than 22","rental_id":229120,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:40.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:40.000000Z"},{"id":5428626,"review":"The experience was very disappointing. The first apartment was in terrible condition, extremely dirty, and filled with dust and grime. The second apartment was somewhat better, but it still had issues— the sink was leaking, the walls were stained, and the floor was covered in hair, dust, and leftover food. The bathrooms were infested with spider webs and mould, while the kitchen hood was excessively greasy.","rental_id":229120,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:45.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:45.000000Z"},{"id":5429839,"review":"Comfortable and up to expectations. \nThank you for your generous hospitality.","rental_id":229120,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:45.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:45.000000Z"},{"id":5493240,"review":"Lovely stay and a wonderful host!","rental_id":229120,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:56.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:56.000000Z"},{"id":5523870,"review":"Teším sa opäť na buducu dovolenku v ubytovaniach od XURU","rental_id":229120,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:58.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:58.000000Z"},{"id":5537544,"review":"All was perfect \nThank you","rental_id":229120,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:58.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:58.000000Z"},{"id":5556112,"review":"Amazing place with very helpful customer service 👌","rental_id":229120,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:01.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:01.000000Z"},{"id":5590033,"review":"Rooms and bathrooms were clean , need to give some attention to the garden and greenery . I have a concern that there is no waredrops in the 2 beds room which was some how difficult to use . \nAnother thing , the reception AC smells bad and need the filters to be cleaned properly. \n\nOverall our stay was very good and i may give it another try later on :) . To me its 4 stars rating .","rental_id":229120,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:06.000000Z"},{"id":5603660,"review":"amazing stay with a great Facility management \nthankyou!!","rental_id":229120,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:10.000000Z"},{"id":5627787,"review":"Alles gut wie immer.","rental_id":229120,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:12.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:12.000000Z"},{"id":5633775,"review":"siamo stati per 10 gg in questo alloggio, comodissimo, vicino alla spiaggia e centro di El Gouna. Supermercato vicinissimo, grande piscina comoda per i bambini, molto tranquillo. quello che ci voleva in vacanza! lo consiglio vivamente, torneremo sicuramente! Xuru stays sempre proattivo e a disposizione","rental_id":229120,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:14.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:14.000000Z"},{"id":5669419,"review":"Es hat alles sehr gut funktioniert, kommen gerne wieder . 👌👌👌","rental_id":229120,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:19.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:19.000000Z"},{"id":5778550,"review":"The location and apartment are great. Xuru was great and responsive. They did forget to send me the code to the lock and had to wait 15 mins but it’s ok. My main problem however was with the smell of the apartment. I think there was something wrong with the plumbing, and there was a HORRIBLE smell outside in the living area, and in the main bedroom a bit. They did send cleaning crew immediately but the place was already really clean, it was a plumbing issue that caused the smell.  It was so bad that i had trouble sleeping night one and ultimately decided to leave one night early and they refunded me that night. To be honest I wouldn’t recommend this exact place at all but I’d recommend xuru stays overall.","rental_id":229120,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z"},{"id":5787911,"review":"Xure is professional and friendly host. it's the second time I book with them and will not the end inshallah. stong recommended","rental_id":229120,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z"},{"id":5836423,"review":"Perfect...one word summarizes all","rental_id":229120,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:45.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:45.000000Z"},{"id":5943689,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":229120,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:10.000000Z"},{"id":6086781,"review":"Great location excellent communication","rental_id":229120,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:23.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:23.000000Z"}],"amenities":[]}